<title>UK: WS Atkins wins UK Railtrack contracts.</title>
<headline>WS Atkins wins UK Railtrack contracts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>British construction and technology consultancy WS Atkins said on Monday that it has two contracts from British rail network operator Railtrack Group Plc with a total value of 6.5 million stg.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the contracts are for the structual examination of Railtrack's railway structures in the Railtrack South and Railtrack Midlands East zones.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
